This project is an INDEPENDENT implementation of the determination method
"Bepalingsmethode materiaalgebonden CO2-opslag" (Construction Stored Carbon),
published by Stichting Climate Cleanup.

It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, approved by, or connected to Stichting
Climate Cleanup, ONCRA, Stichting Nationale Milieudatabase, or any programme
operator whose data it reads.

The method's text, tables and reporting templates are not reproduced here; this
project implements the calculation rules and refers to the published documents.
Carbon fraction values are physical measurements, carried with per-value
attribution to their primary source (Van den Oever et al. 2024, WFBR Report 2545,
DOI 10.18174/647711).

Output of this software is a stored-carbon determination under the named rule set.
It is NOT an MPG or MKI figure, this is NOT a validated rekeninstrument, and no
output may be presented as an official environmental performance calculation.
